        "heading_tag": "h2",
        "heading_size": "h4",
        "text": "<p>Looking to buy an authentic <strong>David Protein bar in India</strong> without international shipping delays or surprise import duties? At <strong>Unmatched Supply</strong> (formerly Unmatched Kicks), we make ordering <strong>David Protein in India</strong> predictable and transparent: every 12-bar box is sourced from vetted US channels, inspected at our Khar West, Mumbai facility, billed in INR, and dispatched Pan-India with zero extra customs fees at delivery.</p><h3>What Makes David Protein Stand Out in India?</h3><p>David Protein bars are built around protein-to-calorie efficiency at 150 calories and 0g sugar. In the flagship <strong>David Protein Gold</strong> line, each bar delivers <strong>28g of protein at 150 calories with 0g sugar</strong> (~75% of calories from protein), making it popular with strength athletes and calorie-tracking buyers across India. For anyone craving a crispy chocolate bar bite without added sugar, the <strong>David Protein Bronze</strong> line supplies <strong>20g of protein at 150 calories with 0g sugar</strong> per bar.</p><h3>David Protein Lineup Available in India</h3><ul><li><strong>David Protein Gold (28g Protein | 150 Calories | 0g Sugar per bar):</strong> High-density 12-bar boxes totaling 336g of protein per box, crafted with a multi-source protein blend (milk protein isolate, whey, collagen, egg white), allulose, and EPG. Flavors stocked across India drops include <strong>Blueberry Pie, Chocolate Chip Cookie Dough, Cinnamon Roll, Red Velvet, Cake Batter, Peanut Butter Chocolate Chunk,</strong> and <strong>Salted Peanut Butter</strong>.</li><li><strong>David Protein Bronze (20g Protein | 150 Calories | 0g Sugar per bar):</strong> Crispy chocolate-coated crunch bars in factory-sealed 12-bar boxes (240g total protein per box) sweetened with sugar alcohols and soluble dietary fiber (up to 6g fiber on Peanut Butter Chocolate Crunch). Flavors include <strong>Cookie Dough Caramel Chocolate Crunch, Peanut Butter Chocolate Crunch, S'mores Chocolate Crunch,</strong> and <strong>Double Chocolate Crunch</strong>.</li><li><strong>Seasonal &amp; Instant Ship Drops:</strong> Limited-batch releases such as <strong>Pumpkin Spice Gold</strong> appear alongside core stock, with <strong>Instant Ship</strong> tags highlighting ready-to-dispatch India boxes.</li></ul><h3>How to Pick Your David Protein Box &amp; Compare INR Cost Per Bar</h3><ul><li><strong>Compare Cost Per Bar Clearly:</strong> Each standard David Protein box contains 12 individually wrapped bars, so dividing the live INR box price shown above by 12 gives your exact landed per-bar price—with no foreign currency FX markup or courier customs bill upon arrival.</li><li><strong>Choose David Protein Gold (28g / 150 cal / 0g sugar):</strong> Best when maximizing daily protein within tight calorie targets. Top flavors include Chocolate Chip Cookie Dough, Blueberry Pie, Cinnamon Roll, Cake Batter, Red Velvet, Peanut Butter Chocolate Chunk, and Salted Peanut Butter.</li><li><strong>Choose David Protein Bronze (20g / 150 cal / 0g sugar):</strong> Best if you enjoy a crisp, chocolate-covered crunch bar experience while staying at 0g total sugar and 150 calories. Picks include Double Chocolate Crunch, S'mores Chocolate Crunch, Peanut Butter Chocolate Crunch, and Cookie Dough Caramel Chocolate Crunch.</li></ul><h3>Mumbai Facility Inspection &amp; Pan-India Delivery</h3><ul><li><strong>Zero Customs Bills at Doorstep:</strong> Unlike overseas marketplaces or US package forwarders where Indian customs duties and courier clearance charges add sharply to checkout costs, every SKU on this page is already imported into India.</li><li><strong>Inspected in Khar West, Mumbai:</strong> Our Mumbai team checks carton seals, lot details, best-by dates, and cool storage handling at Shop No 2, Kashi Kunj, Khar West, Plot No 27, 3rd Road, Mumbai 400052 prior to dispatch.</li><li><strong>Fast Pan-India Dispatch &amp; Direct Support:</strong> Orders above ₹14,999 qualify for free India delivery, Instant Ship flavors leave our facility faster for Mumbai and metro routes, and you can message WhatsApp at <strong>+91 77100 96203</strong> or <a href=\"mailto:unmatchedkicks@gmail.com\">unmatchedkicks@gmail.com</a> for restock ETAs.</li></ul><p>Explore more imported sports nutrition stocked in India: <a href=\"/collections/supplements-instant-ship\">Instant Ship Supplements</a>, <a href=\"/collections/quest-protein-bars\">Quest Protein Bars</a>, <a href=\"/collections/barbell-protein-bar\">Barbell Protein Bars</a>, <a href=\"/collections/ghost-supplements-india\">Ghost Supplements</a>, and <a href=\"/pages/about-us\">About Unmatched Supply</a>.</p>",
